Z||000001||frontal lobe||11-19-2000||12:29 PM||||ChadMan,<P>Sorry to butt in here, but you have my condolensces on the Buckeye/Michigan game.  It never seems HOW much better the Buckeyes are than Michigan, Cooper just CAN'T beat them.  Doesn't that drive you NUTS?<P>Also, add my congratulations to Purdue.  I CANNOT believe that Northwestern was SO STUPID as to have a chance at the Rose Bowl and LOSE to my lowly Iowa Hawkeyes!  (I went to undergraduate college there).<P>While I'm intruding and rambling, I caught the last quarter of the Michigan/Northwestern game a week or two ago.  One of the most unbelievable games I've EVER seen.||||reg||1
